{'symbol': 'JKHY', 'date': '2022-08-09 11:00:00', 'title': 'JACK HENRY & ASSOCIATES TO ACQUIRE PAYRAILZ', 'text': "ACQUISITION OF NEXT-GENERATION, AI-DRIVEN, CLOUD-NATIVE DIGITAL PAYMENT PLATFORM\xa0\xa0 FURTHER EXPANDS JACK HENRY'S PRESENCE AND CAPABILITIES IN THE PAYMENTS INDUSTRY MONETT, MO. , AUG. 9, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- JACK HENRY & ASSOCIATES, INC.® (NASDAQ: JKHY) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT HAS ENTERED INTO A DEFINITIVE AGREEMENT TO ACQUIRE PAYRAILZ, ADDING THE COMPANY'S NEXT-GENERATION DIGITAL PAYMENT CAPABILITIES, INCLUDING REAL-TIME PERSON-TO-PERSON (P2P) PAYMENTS, TO JACK HENRY'S PAYMENTS ECOSYSTEM."}